Package: baseballwins
Title: Compare Baseball Records with Run-Based Expectations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Woohyun", "Kim", email = "woodenkim92@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates Pythagorean winning percentages from runs scored and
    allowed, then compares expected wins with actual team records. Functions
    accept one team or equal-length vectors for several teams and validate
    inputs before calculating results.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/kwoolaid725/baseballwins
BugReports: https://github.com/kwoolaid725/baseballwins/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
